  "aspQPredict": "Drishti prediction ko kaise prabhaavit karti hai",
  "aspGrahaBody": "Grah Drishti woh prabhaav hai jo ek grah apni sthiti se daalta hai. Har grah apne sthaan se 7ve bhaav/grah par poorn drishti daalta hai (ek seedha, aamne-saamne ka prabhaav). Iske alawa, Mangal 4the aur 8ve par, Guru 5ve aur 9ve par, aur Shani 3re aur 10ve par drishti daalta hai. Rahu aur Ketu ko aksar 5vi, 7vi aur 9vi drishti di jaati hai. Kisi grah ki drishti us grah ya bhaav ko apne swabhav ke rang mein rang deti hai.",
  "aspRashiBody": "Rashi Drishti Jaimini jyotish ki ek rashi-se-rashi drishti hai, jo is baat par nirbhar nahi karti ki wahan kaunse grah baithe hain. Char rashiyan sthir rashiyon par drishti daalti hain (paas wali ko chhodkar), sthir rashiyan char rashiyon par drishti daalti hain (paas wali ko chhodkar), aur dwiswabhav rashiyan doosri dwiswabhav rashiyon par drishti daalti hain. Iska upyog mukhya roop se Jaimini prediction aur bhaavon ke beech sambandh aankne mein hota hai.",
  "aspDiffBody": "Grah Drishti ek grah dwara daali jaati hai aur is baat par nirbhar karti hai ki woh grah kahan sthit hai. Rashi Drishti khud rashi ki hoti hai aur usmein jo bhi sthit ho, us par lagu hoti hai. Grah Drishti directional hoti hai (grah A grah B ko dekhta hai), jabki Rashi Drishti aksar rashiyon ke beech mutual hoti hai. Jab dono ek hi target ki taraf ishara karte hain, tab prabhaav khaas taur par prabal hota hai.",
  "aspPredictBody": "Drishti yeh dikhati hai ki ek grah apne bhaav se aage apna prabhaav kahan tak failata hai. Ek shubh drishti (Guru, Shukra, achhi sthiti mein Chandra/Budh) target ko support aur suraksha deti hai; ek ashubh drishti (Shani, Mangal, Surya, Rahu, Ketu) us par dabaav daal sakti hai, deri kar sakti hai ya challenge kar sakti hai. Yeh padhna ki kaunse grah kisi bhaav ya grah par drishti daalte hain, yeh samjhata hai ki result jis tarah se saamne aate hain, waise kyun aate hain.",
  "aspTraitSun": "adhikar, netritva aur jeevan-shakti",
